    "description": "<p><strong>RYUKARI</strong></p>\n<p><em>Your lineage has spent generations watching over places where death, decay and restless spirits gather. You have learned that an ending understood is an ending that can be contained.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Kura Heritage</p>\n<p>You gain Undead Lore as a specialist skill. Furthermore, you gain a +2 racial bonus to Occultism and Religion checks made to identify or Recall Knowledge concerning undead, haunts and magical phenomena associated with death or decay.</p>\n<p><em>Automated:</em> Undead Lore is added as a specialist skill. +2 racial on Occultism and Religion is applied when the check is aimed at an undead or a haunt, and offered as a tick otherwise (death or decay).</p>",
